<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-11-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of Italian first division</p>
<p>soccer matches played on Sunday:</p>
<p>Bologna 3 (Kolyvanov 43rd minute, Marocchi 53, Bresciani 78)</p>
<p>Roma 2 (Balbo 64 and 87 - both penalties). Halftime 1-0.</p>
<p>Attendance: 30,000</p>
<p>Cagliari 2 (Cozza 45, Banchelli 56) Perugia 1 (Pizzi 89). 1-0.</p>
<p>18,000</p>
<p>Juventus 1 (Zidane 43) Napoli 1 (Aglietti 54). 1-0. 35,000</p>
<p>Lazio 0 Vicenza 2 (Murgita 35, Maini 89). 0-1. 35,000</p>
<p>Milan 1 (Albertini 53 - penalty) Atalanta 1 (Inzaghi 21). 0-1.</p>
<p>45,000</p>
<p>Sampdoria 3 (Mancini 15 and 79, Carparelli 53) Piacenza 0. 1-0.</p>
<p>24,000</p>
<p>Udinese 2 (Bierhoff 48, Poggi 87) Reggiana 1 (Valencia 65).</p>
<p>0-0. 15,000</p>
<p>Verona 0 Inter 1 (Zanetti 85). 0-0. 30,000</p>
<p>Add first division summaries: Parma 0 Fiorentina 0. 22,000</p>
</text>
